Vendored third-party OCR engine
===============================

The files in this directory are redistributed copies of Tesseract.js and its WebAssembly
core. They are NOT the work of this project. They are vendored rather than loaded from a
CDN because the app must keep working offline, forever, with no host it depends on.

  tesseract.js          5.1.1   Apache-2.0   tesseract.min.js, worker.min.js
  tesseract.js-core     5.1.1   Apache-2.0   tesseract-core-simd.wasm.js,
                                             tesseract-core-simd-lstm.wasm.js
  eng.traineddata       (tessdata)  Apache-2.0   lang-data/eng.traineddata.gz

  worker-offline.js is GENERATED by tools/vendor-tesseract.js from worker.min.js plus the
  bundled language model, so the Scanner can run from file:// where fetch() is blocked.

